docs {
  # List organization labels

  Authentication: authenticated session cookie; requires any organization membership.
  Expected response: `200` with `items` and `pagination`.
  Error cases: `401` `UNAUTHENTICATED`; `403` `FORBIDDEN`; `422` for invalid pagination.
}
